  "details": "If someone goes into a portal with portal prompting set to off while having an active collider (actual collider, not physbone collider) on their avatar, the portal's user count increases by more than 1. \nThe more colliders the avatar has, the more intense the effect, leading to situations where a single person can kill a portal.\nVideo below showing the bug after 0:31:\nhttps://youtu.be/SLLII_WdRMM?t=31",
